// ODDLY TRUE · 60 s · one sentence = one shot. Bespoke act x3_cook (engine/library/bank/cook.js); generic figures, no likeness.
# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=flip cam=MS.eye.handheld assets="glb/wa-man glb/eu-man glb/la-man glb/local_toilet glb/local_bathroom_sink tex/white_plaster_02 tex/floor_tiles_08 tex/laminate_floor_02 tex/rubber_tiles glb/mixamo_animations_mixamo_rig glb/quaternius_animations_mixamo_rig" sfx=battle_creak@.2
He was on the toilet when his tugboat flipped over and sank.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=night cam=WS.low.push
Around five in the morning, twenty miles off the coast of Nigeria.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=sink cam=EWS.high.crane sfx=hit_sub_drop@.6
The boat hit the seabed upside down, thirty metres down.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=upside cam=MS.low.push
The toilet was now on the ceiling.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=corridor cam=MCU.eye.trackL
Harrison Okene, the ship's cook, felt his way through black water in his underwear.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=surface cam=CU.low.static
In an engineer's cabin, his head broke into a pocket of trapped air.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=cabin cam=WS.eye.push
A bubble just over a metre high, under the upside-down floor.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=wreck cam=EWS.eye.push
Eleven of the twelve crew never made it out.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=can cam=ECU.high.push
In total darkness, he had one can of Coke.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=waterline cam=MS.low.trackL
He kept thinking the water would fill the room… it never did.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=eyes cam=ECU.eye.static
One day passed. Then a second.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=divers cam=WS.high.crane
Almost sixty hours in, a team of divers came down to recover the bodies.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=pass cam=MS.eye.orbit
The first diver swam right past him.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=hand cam=CU.eye.push
Okene reached into the light and grabbed the second diver's hand.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=alive cam=MCU.ots.static
"He's alive! He's alive!"

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=bell cam=WS.low.crane
He went up in a diving bell, then spent three days in a decompression chamber.

# vis kind=w act=x3_cook v=echo cam=MS.eye.push sfx=foley_door_close@.65
It all began with a trip to the toilet, at five in the morning.
